%% Client-streaming RPC: stream IngestEvent → AcceptAck
%% (matches ingest.proto Accept)
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Edge code
  participant Out as outbound StreamObserver<br/>IngestEvent
  participant Net as gRPC channel
  participant In as server StreamObserver<br/>IngestEvent
  participant Svc as IngestGrpcService
  participant Resp as response StreamObserver<br/>AcceptAck

  App->>Out: onNext(event1)
  Out->>Net: send
  Net->>In: onNext(event1)
  In->>Svc: handle event1

  App->>Out: onNext(event2)
  Out->>Net: send
  Net->>In: onNext(event2)

  App->>Out: onCompleted()
  Out->>Net: half-close client stream
  Net->>In: onCompleted()
  Svc->>Resp: onNext(AcceptAck)
  Svc->>Resp: onCompleted()
  Resp->>Net: send ack
  Net->>App: listener onNext(ack) then onCompleted()

  Note over App,Resp: onError(t) from either side aborts the RPC
